  "body": "With million-dollar views and a price point below CV, this is one you need to come see. Imagine starting your morning looking down over Arkles Bay, watching boats move across the water and keeping an eye out for the occasional dolphin. On a clear day, the outlook stretches all the way across to Auckland City, the Sky Tower and Rangitoto. Inside, skylights fill the home with natural light, while the modern kitchen, three bedrooms, two bathrooms and oversized internal-access double garage give you the space and practicality to make everyday life easy.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Views across Arkles Bay to Auckland City & Rangitoto\r\n* Bright, light-filled open plan living\r\n* Modern kitchen with excellent functionality\r\n* Three generous bedrooms plus an office\r\n* Heat pump and gas fireplace for year round comfort\r\n* Oversized internal-access double garage\r\n* Tucked away down a ROW for added privacy\r\n* Close to Coast Plaza, schools and bus services\r\n* Short walk to beautiful Arkles Bay Beach\r\n\r\nTucked privately down a ROW, you're close to the everyday essentials while still enjoying that coveted coastal outlook. Coast Plaza, local schools, public transport and Arkles Bay Beach are all within easy reach. With the Penlink project set to further improve connectivity to the peninsula, this desirable coastal community is becoming even easier to access, there's good reason to make your move here now.\r\n\r\nIf you've been searching for a home with a genuinely impressive view, plus a location that makes life easy, 769B Whangaparaoa Road deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/498T\r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
